            <div class=3D"post-body u-relative" style=3D"height: auto !impo=
rtant;">
    <div class=3D"post-body-wrap" style=3D"height: auto !important;">
        <div class=3D"post-inner js-post-content" data-article-navigation=
=3D"" data-toc-title=3D"On this page" data-copy-section=3D"Copy section lin=
k" data-link-copied=3D"Section link copied." data-link-fallback=3D"Copy thi=
s section link" style=3D"height: auto !important;"><p>If you're using nginx=
 on Ubuntu, you'll quickly discover that the default Ubuntu version bundled=
 with the operating system is quite outdated. This implies the necessity of=
 running the latest Nginx version to mitigate potential security issues. Th=
is article guides you through the process of upgrading the nginx to the <a =
href=3D"https://nginx.org/en/download.html?ref=3Ddeveloperinsider.co" targe=
t=3D"_blank">latest stable version</a> on Ubuntu.</p>
<p>To check your current Nginx version, run the following command:</p>
<div class=3D"di-code-block"><div class=3D"di-code-header"><span class=3D"d=
i-code-label">Shell</span><button type=3D"button" class=3D"di-code-copy" ar=
ia-label=3D"Copy Shell code">Copy</button><span class=3D"di-code-status" ro=
le=3D"status" aria-live=3D"polite"></span></div><pre tabindex=3D"0" aria-la=
bel=3D"Shell code" class=3D"language-sh"><code class=3D"language-sh">nginx =
<span class=3D"token parameter variable">-v</span>
</code></pre></div>
<p>Now, to update nginx to the latest stable version on Ubuntu, you can fol=
low these steps.</p>
<h2 id=3D"1-backup-configuration" tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"di-section-headi=
ng">1. Backup configuration<a class=3D"di-section-link" href=3D"https://dev=
eloperinsider.co/install-update-nginx-to-the-latest-stable-version-on-ubunt=
u/#1-backup-configuration" aria-label=3D"Copy section link: 1. Backup confi=
guration" title=3D"Copy section link"><svg class=3D"icon" aria-hidden=3D"tr=
ue"><use href=3D"#icon-link"></use></svg></a></h2>
<p>Before you update nginx, it's a good practice to back up your current ng=
inx configuration. Run the following command to backup:</p>
<div class=3D"di-code-block"><div class=3D"di-code-header"><span class=3D"d=
i-code-label">Shell</span><button type=3D"button" class=3D"di-code-copy" ar=
ia-label=3D"Copy Shell code">Copy</button><span class=3D"di-code-status" ro=
le=3D"status" aria-live=3D"polite"></span></div><pre tabindex=3D"0" aria-la=
bel=3D"Shell code" class=3D"language-sh"><code class=3D"language-sh"><span =
class=3D"token function">sudo</span> <span class=3D"token function">cp</spa=
n> <span class=3D"token parameter variable">-r</span> /etc/nginx /etc/nginx=
_backup
</code></pre></div>
<h2 id=3D"2-install-the-prerequisites" tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"di-section-=
heading">2. Install the prerequisites<a class=3D"di-section-link" href=3D"h=
ttps://developerinsider.co/install-update-nginx-to-the-latest-stable-versio=
n-on-ubuntu/#2-install-the-prerequisites" aria-label=3D"Copy section link: =
2. Install the prerequisites" title=3D"Copy section link"><svg class=3D"ico=
n" aria-hidden=3D"true"><use href=3D"#icon-link"></use></svg></a></h2>
<div class=3D"di-code-block"><div class=3D"di-code-header"><span class=3D"d=
i-code-label">Shell</span><button type=3D"button" class=3D"di-code-copy" ar=
ia-label=3D"Copy Shell code">Copy</button><span class=3D"di-code-status" ro=
le=3D"status" aria-live=3D"polite"></span></div><pre tabindex=3D"0" aria-la=
bel=3D"Shell code" class=3D"language-sh"><code class=3D"language-sh"><span =
class=3D"token function">sudo</span> <span class=3D"token function">apt</sp=
an> <span class=3D"token function">install</span> <span class=3D"token func=
tion">curl</span> gnupg2 ca-certificates lsb-release ubuntu-keyring
</code></pre></div>
<h2 id=3D"3-improt-nginx-signing-key" tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"di-section-h=
eading">3. Improt nginx signing key<a class=3D"di-section-link" href=3D"htt=
ps://developerinsider.co/install-update-nginx-to-the-latest-stable-version-=
on-ubuntu/#3-improt-nginx-signing-key" aria-label=3D"Copy section link: 3. =
Improt nginx signing key" title=3D"Copy section link"><svg class=3D"icon" a=
ria-hidden=3D"true"><use href=3D"#icon-link"></use></svg></a></h2>
<p>Import the official nginx signing key so apt could verify the packages a=
uthenticity. Run the following command to fetch the key:</p>
<div class=3D"di-code-block"><div class=3D"di-code-header"><span class=3D"d=
i-code-label">Shell</span><button type=3D"button" class=3D"di-code-copy" ar=
ia-label=3D"Copy Shell code">Copy</button><span class=3D"di-code-status" ro=
le=3D"status" aria-live=3D"polite"></span></div><pre tabindex=3D"0" aria-la=
bel=3D"Shell code" class=3D"language-sh"><code class=3D"language-sh"><span =
class=3D"token function">curl</span> https://nginx.org/keys/nginx_signing.k=
ey <span class=3D"token operator">|</span> gpg <span class=3D"token paramet=
er variable">--dearmor</span> <span class=3D"token punctuation">\</span>
    <span class=3D"token operator">|</span> <span class=3D"token function">=
sudo</span> <span class=3D"token function">tee</span> /usr/share/keyrings/n=
ginx-archive-keyring.gpg <span class=3D"token operator">&gt;</span>/dev/nul=
l
</code></pre></div>
<p>Now, verify that the downloaded file contains the proper key by running =
the following command:</p>
<div class=3D"di-code-block"><div class=3D"di-code-header"><span class=3D"d=
i-code-label">Shell</span><button type=3D"button" class=3D"di-code-copy" ar=
ia-label=3D"Copy Shell code">Copy</button><span class=3D"di-code-status" ro=
le=3D"status" aria-live=3D"polite"></span></div><pre tabindex=3D"0" aria-la=
bel=3D"Shell code" class=3D"language-sh"><code class=3D"language-sh">gpg --=
dry-run <span class=3D"token parameter variable">--quiet</span> --no-keyrin=
g <span class=3D"token parameter variable">--import</span> --import-options=
 import-show /usr/share/keyrings/nginx-archive-keyring.gpg
</code></pre></div>
<p>The output should contain the full fingerprint <code>573BFD6B3D8FBC64107=
9A6ABABF5BD827BD9BF62</code>. If the fingerprint is different, remove the f=
ile immediately and do not proceed further.</p>
<p><button type=3D"button" class=3D"di-image-open" aria-haspopup=3D"dialog"=
 aria-label=3D"Article images"><img src=3D"https://cdn.developerinsider.co/=
images/linux/update-nginx/nginx-fingerprint-key.webp" alt=3D"" loading=3D"l=
azy"></button></p>
<h2 id=3D"4-installupdate-latest-stable-version" tabindex=3D"-1" class=3D"d=
